{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"RemovedComponents"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"C"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Component","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Component","preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule9ComponentP"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The collection holds each entity that lost a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"C"},{"type":"text","text":", whether the component was removed or the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"entity despawned, oldest first. The following system scores a point for each entity that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"thawed:"}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["@System","struct CountThawed {","    func run(_ thawed: RemovedComponents<Frozen>, _ score: ResourceWriter<Score>) {","        score.value.points += thawed.count","    }","}","","var world = World()","world.resources.insert(Score(points: 0))","let statue = world.spawn(Position(x: 0, y: 0), Frozen())","let frame = Schedule { CountThawed() }","frame.run(on: &world)","","world.remove(Frozen.self, from: statue)","frame.run(on: &world)","print(world.resources[Score.self].points)","\/\/ Prints \"1\""]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The schedule starts recording removals of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"C"},{"type":"text","text":" ("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/Wo